[27.856559, "o", "s enclosed for the court.\r\n288|ST-558|tone|firm formal brief|OI-201|Adopt a firm, formal and brief style.\r\n289|ST-559|concern|position only|OI-299|I raise only the position she has been put in.\r\n290|ST-560|behavioural_plan|full CL match|OI-299|The behavioural plan covers confidence, stability and peer relations; the stays have set back confidence only.\r\n291|ST-561|interim_contact|all three aspects together|CL-308|Pending the final order, interim contact with Ms Corwin should be framed to support Imogen's confidence, her stability and her peer relations together.\r\n292|ST-562|interim_contact|confidence stability peer relations jointly|CL-310|Any interim contact arrangement must work across all three pillars of the plan — confidence, stability and peer relations — rather than picking one alone.\r\n293|ST-563|interim_contact|all three aspects jointly|OI-207|Interim contact pending resolution ought to hold confidence, stability and peer relations in view at the same time, because interim contact touches each of "]
[27.856782, "o", "them.\r\n294|ST-564|interim_contact|all three addressed together|CL-310|Until the matter is resolved, contact with Ms Corwin must be arranged so that confidence, stability and peer relations are all addressed, not one in isolation.\r\n295|ST-565|interim_contact|confidence stability peer relations all three|CL-308|The interim contact schedule should be built around confidence, stability and peer relations jointly, since interim contact bears on all three.\r\n296|ST-566|interim_contact|confidence only|CL-308|Pending resolution, interim contact with Ms Corwin should be arranged to support Imogen's confidence.\r\n297|ST-567|interim_contact|confidence the aspect set back|CL-308|Interim contact pending the final order need only address confidence, as that is the aspect the stays have set back.\r\n298|ST-568|interim_contact|confidence above all|OI-207|Until the matter is resolved, contact with Ms Corwin should focus on confidence above all else.\r\n299|ST-569|interim_contact|confidence the only aspect set back|CL-308|The interi"]
[27.857012, "o", "m contact schedule should be built around confidence, because that is the only aspect the stays have set back.\r\n300|ST-570|interim_contact|confidence only despite citation|CL-310|Any interim contact arrangement pending resolution need only consider confidence, the aspect the stays affected.\r\n301|ST-571|without_prejudice|soft conciliatory tone|CL-307|Without prejudice, I write in a conciliatory spirit to explore whether common ground can be found for the children's sake.\r\n302|ST-572|without_prejudice|soft tone settlement offer|CL-311|Marked without prejudice, this letter is framed softly and without rancour, as befits a genuine attempt to settle.\r\n303|ST-573|without_prejudice|conciliatory and open|OI-210|On a without prejudice basis, the tone here is deliberately gentle and conciliatory, inviting agreement rather than contest.\r\n304|ST-574|without_prejudice|soft and measured|CL-307|Sent without prejudice, the letter adopts a soft and measured tone throughout, in keeping with its purpose as a settlement offer.\r\n"]
[27.857193, "o", "305|ST-575|without_prejudice|gentle settlement tone|CL-311|This without prejudice communication is written gently and without assertion, so as to keep the door open to resolution.\r\n306|ST-576|without_prejudice|firm and direct|CL-307|Without prejudice, I set out the position firmly and directly, leaving no room for misunderstanding.\r\n307|ST-577|without_prejudice|firm formal brief|CL-307|Marked without prejudice, the letter is firm, formal and brief in keeping with the tone the clarification requires.\r\n308|ST-578|without_prejudice|firm and uncompromising|OI-210|On a without prejudice basis, the tone throughout is firm and uncompromising, as the client's instructions demand.\r\n309|ST-579|without_prejudice|firm despite without prejudice|CL-311|Sent without prejudice, the position is stated firmly and without concession, though the label invites settlement.\r\n310|ST-580|without_prejudice|firm formal and at length|CL-307|Without prejudice, I keep the letter firm, formal and at length, setting out every point in full "]
