[394.802866, "o", "nterim_contact|confidence the only aspect set back|CL-308->behavioural_plan|The interim contact schedule should be built around confidence, because that is the only aspect the stays have set back.\r\n301|ST-571|without_prejudice|soft conciliatory tone|CL-307->tone|Without prejudice, I write in a conciliatory spirit to explore whether common ground can be found for the children's sake.\r\n304|ST-574|without_prejudice|soft and measured|CL-307->tone|Sent without prejudice, the letter adopts a soft and measured tone throughout, in keeping with its purpose as a settlement offer.\r\n306|ST-576|without_prejudice|firm and direct|CL-307->tone|Without prejudice, I set out the position firmly and directly, leaving no room for misunderstanding.\r\n307|ST-577|without_prejudice|firm formal brief|CL-307->tone|Marked without prejudice, the letter is firm, formal and brief in keeping with the tone the clarification requires.\r\n310|ST-580|without_prejudice|firm formal and at length|CL-307->tone|Without prejudice, I keep the letter firm"]
[394.803229, "o", ", formal and at length, setting out every point in full detail.\r\n311|ST-581|tone|soft formal succinct|CL-309->concern|The letter should be kept soft, formal and succinct throughout.\r\n312|ST-582|tone|firm formal brief|CL-308->behavioural_plan|Set a firm, formal and brief tone throughout the letter.\r\n313|ST-583|concern|both limbs|CL-307->tone|It concerns me that Ms Corwin may not appreciate the stays violate the order, and I am also concerned about the position she has been placed in.\r\n314|ST-584|concern|position only|CL-306->delivery|My concern is solely the position Ms Corwin has been placed in.\r\n315|ST-585|behavioural_plan|confidence stability setback|CL-309->concern|The behavioural plan is built around confidence and stability, and the stays have set that plan back.\r\n316|ST-586|behavioural_plan|CL match confidence-only setback|CL-307->tone|Her behavioural plan addresses confidence, stability and peer relations, and the stays have set back her confidence alone.\r\n317|ST-587|addressee|father's attorney|CL-307-"]
[394.803529, "o", ">tone|Please direct this letter to the attorney acting for the father.\r\n318|ST-588|addressee|mother's attorney|CL-308->behavioural_plan|This letter is to be sent to counsel for the mother.\r\n319|ST-589|request|neither child overnight unless father present|CL-309->concern|Neither child ought to stay overnight in Ms Corwin's care unless Mr Adler is present.\r\n320|ST-590|request|unless mother present|CL-304->salutation|Neither child should stay overnight with her unless the mother is present.\r\n321|ST-591|enclosure|certified copy|CL-306->delivery|Enclosed with this letter is a certified copy of the custodial plan.\r\n322|ST-592|enclosure|uncertified summary|CL-307->tone|Enclosed is an uncertified draft summary of the custodial plan.\r\n323|ST-593|tone|warm and conversational|CL-305->copies|The tone should be warm and conversational throughout.\r\n324|ST-594|concern|both limbs|CL-303->enclosure|I have a concern that she may not appreciate the stays contravene the order, as well as about the position she has been put in.\r\n"]
