[1039.537286, "o", "out firmly and in full detail below.\r\nST-127|warm and personal|OI-210|The letter is written in a warm and personal tone, reflecting the ongoing relationship between the parents.\r\nST-137|firm and at length|CL-304|Set out the position firmly and at length.\r\nST-145|firm and detailed|CL-304|I set out the position firmly and in full detail below.\r\nST-163|firm and at length|CL-302|Set out the position firmly and at length.\r\nST-186|firm and direct|CL-305|Keep the letter firm and direct.\r\nST-187|firm and direct|CL-306|The tone throughout is firm and direct.\r\n"]
